WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
[Original instrumental music]
Forms should feel like a conversation.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Meet Openform. Beautiful forms. A little more human.

00:08.000 --> 00:14.000
Build your form. Choose your questions, find your colors, and make it yours.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
Ask one question at a time. Give every answer some breathing room.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.000
Listen to the responses. Look closer, or export your answers as CSV.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Your questions. Your data. Your code.
Open source. MIT licensed. Try it. Fork it. Make it yours.
